<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγκᾰθεν</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the arms,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. λαβεῖν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					80
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>resting on the elbows,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; also expl. as 
				contr.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέκαθεν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνωθεν</span>
			, <i>on the top,</i> cf. Sch. ad l. c.,
				<i><span class="en">Hsch.,
				<u>AB</u>337</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
